{
  "name": "Conference Tool — Authentik Group Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\nEdit the **Config** node before using this workflow:\n- `authentik_base_url` — `http://authentik-server:9000` is correct for the bundled test compose stack\n- `authentik_token` — create one in Authentik Admin → Directory → Tokens & App passwords → Create (intent: **API**)\n\n## Events handled\n\n| Event | Action |\n|---|---|\n| `committee.oidc_group_added` | Create Authentik group if it doesn't already exist |\n| `committee.oidc_group_removed` | Delete group if we created it and no other committee still references it |\n| `committee.deleted` | Delete each orphaned group we created |\n| `committee.created` | No-op (no groups attached yet) |\n\n## Ownership tagging\n\nGroups created by this workflow have:\n```\nattributes.managed_by  = \"n8n-caucus-handler\"\nattributes.created_for = \"<group_name>\"\n```\nOnly groups carrying this tag are ever deleted.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, -200]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "meeting-events",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "noData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Receive Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "caucus-meeting-events"
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-url",
              "name": "authentik_base_url",
              "value": "http://authentik-server:9000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-token",
              "name": "authentik_token",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_AUTHENTIK_API_TOKEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-marker",
              "name": "managed_by_marker",
              "value": "n8n-caucus-handler",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-webhooksecret",
              "name": "webhook_secret",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WEBHOOK_SECRET",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "includeOtherFields": true }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "auth-header-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ !$json.webhook_secret || $json.headers['x-webhook-secret'] === $json.webhook_secret }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001a",
      "name": "Auth Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            { "value2": "committee.oidc_group_added",  "output": 0 },
            { "value2": "committee.oidc_group_removed", "output": 1 },
            { "value2": "committee.deleted",            "output": 2 }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 3
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Route by Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## committee.oidc_group_added\n\nA new OIDC group rule was added to a committee.\nCreate the group in Authentik if it doesn't exist yet.\nIdempotent: if another committee rule already caused creation, skip.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Note: group added",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, -60]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url }}/api/v3/core/groups/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Event').item.json.body.group.group_name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Look Up Group (add)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 100]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-add-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.pagination.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Group Not Yet in Authentik?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1200, 100]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url }}/api/v3/core/groups/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ name: $('Receive Event').item.json.body.group.group_name, attributes: { managed_by: $('Config').item.json.managed_by_marker, created_for: $('Receive Event').item.json.body.group.group_name, committee_slug: $('Receive Event').item.json.body.committee.slug } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Create Group",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1440, 20]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## committee.oidc_group_removed\n\nA group rule was removed from a committee.\nOnly delete the Authentik group if:\n1. We created it (managed_by tag present)\n2. No other committee still references it\n   (`still_referenced_by_other_committees: false`)",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Note: group removed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 260]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-rem-orphan",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Receive Event').item.json.body.group.still_referenced_by_other_committees }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Still Used by Other Committees?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [960, 420]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url }}/api/v3/core/groups/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Event').item.json.body.group.group_name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Look Up Group (remove)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1200, 360]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-rem-exists",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.pagination.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            },
            {
              "id": "if-rem-owned",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.results[0].attributes.managed_by }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Config').item.json.managed_by_marker }}",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Group Exists and We Own It? (remove)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1440, 360]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url + '/api/v3/core/groups/' + $('Look Up Group (remove)').item.json.results[0].pk + '/' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013",
      "name": "Delete Group (remove path)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1680, 280]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## committee.deleted\n\nThe entire committee was deleted.\nIterate over each group in `oidc_groups` and delete those\nthat are orphaned (`still_referenced_by_other_committees: false`)\nand that we created.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014",
      "name": "Note: committee deleted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 560]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.oidc_groups",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
      "name": "Split Orphaned Groups",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 720]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-del-orphan",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.still_referenced_by_other_committees }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000016",
      "name": "Is This Group Orphaned?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1200, 720]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url }}/api/v3/core/groups/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.group_name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017",
      "name": "Look Up Group (delete path)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1440, 640]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-del-exists",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.pagination.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            },
            {
              "id": "if-del-owned",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.results[0].attributes.managed_by }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Config').item.json.managed_by_marker }}",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000018",
      "name": "Group Exists and We Own It? (delete)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1680, 640]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_base_url + '/api/v3/core/groups/' + $('Look Up Group (delete path)').item.json.results[0].pk + '/' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.authentik_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "name": "Delete Group (delete path)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1920, 560]
    }
  ],

  "connections": {
